    slug: 'recurring-maintenance-contract-software',
    title: 'Landscaping Software for Recurring Maintenance Contracts',
    description: 'Learn how landscaping software automates recurring maintenance contracts so every visit is scheduled, billed, and tracked without manual effort.',
