    intro: 'A lawn and landscape company rarely sells just one thing. The same customer might get weekly mowing, a spring cleanup, fertilization rounds, and a patio install, and each service follows its own schedule, pricing, and billing logic. When you track them in separate tools, the picture fractures and money slips through the cracks. Combined service management inside [lawn and landscape software](/lawn-and-landscape-software) keeps every service for a customer connected under one record, so mowing, treatments, cleanups, and design jobs all live together. This article explains how that unified approach works and why it matters. We will cover one customer with many services, juggling different cycles on one calendar, pricing each service correctly, billing across them, cross selling, and building a single source of truth. IndustryBossPro delivers all of this in one platform at 199 dollars per month, so the services you sell stop competing for attention in disconnected systems and start working as one coordinated operation.',
